    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>When a PC rolls with Fear, spend a Fear to Sap them of their prowess in the trait used for the roll, until they spend 3 Hope or roll with Hope using the trait. A Sapped target inverts their trait modifier for the chosen trait (for example, a +3 becomes a -3). </p><blockquote><p>What is a time when you used this trait cruelly or selfishly?</p></blockquote>",
